## 📋 Control Node Prerequisites

Because this inventory uses **SSH username and password authentication**, ensure `sshpass` is installed on your Ansible control machine (Linux or WSL2):

```bash
# Debian / Ubuntu / WSL2
sudo apt update && sudo apt install -y sshpass

# RHEL / Rocky / Fedora
sudo dnf install -y sshpass
```

Install Python dependencies and Ansible Galaxy collections:

```bash
python3 -m venv .venv
source .venv/bin/activate
pip install ansible-core ansible-lint molecule molecule-plugins[{{ container_driver }}]
ansible-galaxy collection install -r requirements.yml
```

---

## 🔐 Encrypting Your SSH Password (`ansible-vault`)

Your initial SSH password was saved in `inventories/dev/group_vars/all/vault.yml`. Encrypt it before committing to Git:

```bash
ansible-vault encrypt inventories/dev/group_vars/all/vault.yml
```

---

## 🚀 Running Playbooks

### Check Connectivity (`ping`)
```bash
ansible all -m ansible.builtin.ping --ask-vault-pass
```

### Apply Rootless Podman Configuration
```bash
ansible-playbook playbooks/site.yml --ask-vault-pass
```
*(If `vault.yml` is not yet encrypted, omit `--ask-vault-pass`.)*

### Run Molecule Verification (`{{ linux_distro }}`)
```bash
molecule test
```
